    "caption": "🚀 What an incredible weekend at the NASA Space Apps Challenge organized by American Corner and Makerspace Pavlodar on October 5-6, 2024! 🌍\n\nWith 36 participants across 7 teams, the 24-hour hackathon was filled with innovation, creativity, and unstoppable energy. 💡 The teams worked tirelessly to solve global challenges, showcasing their tech skills and problem-solving abilities.\n\nA huge shoutout to our amazing mentors, judges, volunteers, and of course, the incredible participants who made this event possible. 🙌 Your dedication and passion were truly inspiring!\nSpecial thanks to our partners at this event @pavlodar.hub \n\nStay tuned for more exciting events, and thank you for being a part of this unforgettable journey! 🌟\n\n#SpaceAppsPavlodar #usinkz @nasa_spaceapps",
